Error [E0032]: Jet doesn't use the `lambda` keyword for short functions
  --> tests/ui/foreign_lambda.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     lambda x: x + 1;
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: write a lambda with parentheses and `=>` instead
 Fix: e.g. `(x) => x + 1` instead of `lambda x { ... }`

Error [E0003]: this line computes a value but doesn't do anything with it
  --> tests/ui/foreign_lambda.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     lambda x: x + 1;
    |            ^
 Why: a statement must have an effect: a call, a binding, an assignment, or `return`
 Fix: use the value, e.g. `x :: ...` or `print(...)`
